<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Verify your Skilora account</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #09090b; color: #d4d4d8; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 560px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px; }
        .card { background: #18181b; border: 1px solid #27272a; border-radius: 12px; padding: 40px; }
        .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin: 0 0 12px; }
        p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #6366f1; color: #fff; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 28px; }
        .expiry { font-size: 12px; color: #52525b; }
        .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #52525b; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="logo">Skilora</div>
            <h1>Verify your email address</h1>
            <p>Hi {{ user.fullName ?? user.username }},<br>
               Thanks for registering! Click the button below to verify your email address and activate your account.</p>
            <a href="{{ signedUrl }}" class="btn">Verify my email</a>
            <p class="expiry">This link expires on {{ expiresAt|date('F j, Y \\a\\t g:i A') }}.</p>
            <p>If you didn't create a Skilora account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Skilora. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
